# every WEFT block on a saw (block 1), heard as the output; the ones that make clicks or levels (not sound) only
# run. Catches a block that blows up or stays silent
wait 300
kind 1 6
wset 1 0 1 2
wset 1 7 1 85
wset 1 5 0 2
# PHASE
wset 1 0 2 1
wset 1 1 2 1
wset 1 3 2 100
key 12 down
wait 300
expect meter_min 1 0.002
key 12 up
wait 150
